  "id": "BIT-kyverno-2026-122319",
  "summary": "Kyverno before 1.19.2 Denial of Service via In/NotIn Operator Panic",
  "details": "Kyverno before 1.19.2 contains a denial-of-service vulnerability in the In and NotIn operators that allows attackers to crash the policy engine via an unchecked type assertion. Attackers can submit resources whose JMESPath-evaluated values yield arrays of integers, booleans, or mixed types, triggering a panic that disrupts admission control and policy enforcement.",
